msgstr "Caminho fora da pasta de destino no ZIP (zip-slip)."

#: apps/themes/package.py
msgid ""
"The real size of the extracted files exceeds the limit (possible zip bomb)."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho real dos arquivos extraídos excede o limite (possível bomba zip)."

#: apps/themes/package.py
msgid ""
"The real size of one of the files does not match the ZIP declaration; the "
